message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Comparative Dataset of Computing, Digital Education and Digital Citizenship Curricula in Basic Education"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Moraes"
    given-names: "Denise"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/deniaulainfead23/ragdiretrizes"
abstract: >-
  Comparative dataset derived from official curriculum documents related to
  Computing, Digital Education, Computational Thinking and Digital Citizenship
  in Basic Education. The dataset includes bibliographic and provenance
  metadata, lexical indicators, similarity matrices and validated documentary
  evidence. Original third-party curriculum documents are referenced by their
  official sources and checksums and are not redistributed unless permitted by
  their licensing conditions.
keywords:
  - digital education
  - computational thinking
  - computing education
  - digital citizenship
  - comparative education
  - curriculum
  - natural language processing
  - digital humanities
  - retrieval-augmented generation
